# Wrapper scopes for `SaraWorld`

> Module SaraWorldWrappers

> Using SaraWorld as Src

Generated by `cutecat_scripts/generate_dataset.py`; edits are
overwritten. Each scope below adds no rule: it declares one input
per parameter of a top-level function of the port and returns what
that function returns. CUTECat explores one entry point per run,
and a top-level function is not one until something names it.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope FnFirstDayYear:
  input y content integer
  output result content date

declaration scope FnLastDayYear:
  input y content integer
  output result content date

declaration scope FnArgMatches:
  input injected content integer
  input wanted content integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnInjectionMatches:
  input inj content Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnPredOverridden:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnPredAvailable:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnInjectionsFor:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  output result content list of Src.Injection

declaration scope FnInjectedHolds:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnInjectedMoney:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of money

declaration scope FnInjectionEntity:
  input inj content Src.Injection
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of Src.Entity

declaration scope FnInjectionDate:
  input inj content Src.Injection
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of date

declaration scope FnInjectionNum:
  input inj content Src.Injection
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of integer

declaration scope FnInjectedNum:
  input injections content list of Src.Injection
  input pred content integer
  input pattern content list of integer
  input pos content integer
  output result content optional of integer

declaration scope FnNumKey:
  input n content integer
  output result content integer

declaration scope FnMoneyKey:
  input m content money
  output result content money

declaration scope FnEntityOfKey:
  input k content integer
  output result content optional of Src.Entity

```

```catala
scope FnFirstDayYear:
  definition result equals Src.first_day_year of y

scope FnLastDayYear:
  definition result equals Src.last_day_year of y

